<title>JORDAN: Jordan overnight rates in 8.25-8.50 pct range.</title>
<headline>Jordan overnight rates in 8.25-8.50 pct range.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight rates on the Jordanian dinar eased to 8.25-8.50 percent on Monday from 8.50-8.75 percent on Sunday amid higher liquidity, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The tight market that has persisted has eased slightly and some banks appear not to have rolled over this week's maturing CD's (certificates of deposit) so helping to relax the market,&quot; one dealer said.</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
